  L('m2c8-1', 'm2c8', 'Metrics to evaluate supervised learning models',
`Choose metrics that match the **type of target** and the **business question**:

• **Continuous outcomes** (regression): errors such as MSE, RMSE, MAE, MAPE, and R².
• **Classification**: the **confusion matrix** and metrics derived from it (accuracy, precision, recall, specificity, F1), plus threshold-free measures such as **ROC-AUC**, the **Gini coefficient** (= 2·AUC − 1, common in credit scoring) and **log-loss**.
• **Calibration**: do predicted probabilities match observed frequencies (e.g. predicted PD 2% → about 2% default)? Important for pricing and capital.

