  L('m2c9-4', 'm2c9', 'Dictionary approach versus machine-learning approach',
`**Dictionary (lexicon) approach**
• Uses predefined word lists with categories or scores (e.g. **Loughran–McDonald** finance sentiment lists; general lists like Harvard GI).
• Score = count of positive minus negative words (often scaled).
